| **"Let's Discuss"** | Enter discussion-only mode | No code generation, pure planning |
| **"Let's Update"** | Update documentation | Immediate doc refresh across project |
| **"Let's Go Back"** | Context refresh | Execute Rule 19 protocol |
| **"Let's Remember"** | Context refresh | Execute Rule 19 protocol |
| **"You're in a Loop"** | Emergency loop break | Execute Rule 19 emergency protocol |
| **"Make Note"** | Force memory storage | Store immediately, explicit request category |
| **"Remember This"** | Force memory storage | Store immediately, explicit request category |
| **"ONBOARD YOURSELF"** | Full project onboarding | Execute Rule 26 onboarding protocol |
| **"Clean House"** | Production audit | Execute Rule 27 cleanup protocol |
| **"BEGIN DEBUGGING PROTOCOL"** | Enter nuclear debug mode | Execute Rule 24 NUCLEAR protocol |
| **"ACTIVATE HELP PROCEDURES"** | Audit the Entire Code base - Implement Rule 28 - On/About Every node |
